---
description: Every outbound message is a draft the owner approves
alwaysApply: true
---

<!-- Grok Bot, 2026-10-15: draft-before-send is the only default outbound path (SPEC §9). -->

draft-before-send:

- Produce outbound email/messages as drafts for the owner to review and send.
- "Send it" approves that one message only; it is not a standing permission.
- Calendar invites with attendees, deletions, and refund promises need the owner's explicit OK in the current turn.
- If a draft tool is unavailable, show the full text in chat and stop. Don't fall back to a direct send.
